# Last Light of Durin's Day, the sixth Mountain (turn 11): "a Dragon card" is one card, whichever zone it is found in. Bot1 takes
# the Smaug from its hand and also searches its library (to shuffle it): the search finds no second Dragon card, so the Draconic Visitor
# stays in the library - though the library is shuffled, which declining the search would not do.

